   "questions": [
    "Must the modification time be the `modified` value from the ready `SourceFile` that contains these exact bytes, or may the caller supply another modification-time observation of the source?",
    "What exact value and representation is passed as the modification time, and must it be the `modified` value captured from the same opened file as these bytes?"
   ],
